@startuml
[*] --> New User : Initial State
New User --> Registered User : Registration Completion
Registered User --> Signed In : Successful Sign-in
Signed In --> Access Denied : Registration Failure
Signed In --> Payment Processing : Viewing a Result or Selecting Payment Method
Payment Processing --> Service Completed : Completing Payment Process
Service Completed --> Session Ended : Session Timeout/End

Access Denied --> [*] : Final State
Session Ended --> [*] : Final State

@enduml
